{"id":"47757ea7c4cfcbd4","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-nonstandard-model.md","title":"Nonstandard Model","display":"df-nonstandard-model — Nonstandard Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-nonstandard-model","aliases":["92-df-nonstandard-model"],"display":"df-nonstandard-model — Nonstandard Model","depends_on":["[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-nonstandard-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-nonstandard-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonstandard-model — Nonstandard Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (arithmetic structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano arithmetic axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonStd}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{NonStd}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\land\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PA}\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|M|)\\;(M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\Bigr]\n\\land M\\not\\cong\\mathfrak N_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\land\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PA}\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|M|)\\;(M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\Bigr]\n\\land M\\not\\cong\\mathfrak N_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>非标准模型：满足PA但不同构于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span></li>\n<li>由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>及扩张语言中的紧致性论证可得PA的非标准模型</li>\n<li>非标准模型包含&quot;非标准元素&quot;（无穷大元素）</li>\n<li>非标准元素大于所有标准自然数</li>\n<li>每个可数非标准PA模型的线性序具有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega+(\\mathbb Z\\cdot\\mathbb Q)\">\\(\\omega+(\\mathbb Z\\cdot\\mathbb Q)\\)</span>型的标准描述；不能把这一可数情形的序型公式无条件套到任意基数的模型</li>\n<li>若某个独立句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\gamma\\)</span>相容，则完备性给出令<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>为假的非标准PA模型；“Gödel句在非标准模型中可假”依赖这一相容性前提</li>\n<li>溢出原理（overspill）是非标准模型的特征</li>\n<li>非标准模型分析揭示PA的局限</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"89c